{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Just click Spawn buttons!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">just spawn attackers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then it will automatically attack the enemies that are rushing in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Test your luck!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When spawning an attacker, its level is randomly determined and hidden may appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Especially hidden has a very good ability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Luck isn't always necessary.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden is spawned according to probability, but you can increase the hidden chance, and if you spawn a certain number of hiddens through probability adjustment, hidden is unconditionally spawned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The effectiveness of the attacker can be increased through appropriate upgrades.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803680?t=1754437192","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803680?t=1754437192","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803680/777ea3dfd8af4abd225504682c21c5fbee78022e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754437192","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803680/777ea3dfd8af4abd225504682c21c5fbee78022e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754437192","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Just click Spawn buttons!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">just spawn attackers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then it will automatically attack the enemies that are rushing in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Test your luck!</i><